5789 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 5790 0 R/Alt(Two panels sharing a horizontal axis, kz over 2 pi from 0 to 2, that is, two wavelengths. Top: the displacement xi over A is a cosine, starting at 1; the density perturbation is a sine, dashed, starting at 0, so it is shifted by a quarter of a wavelength. The density is largest at kz over 2 pi equal to 0.25 and 1.25, where the displacement crosses zero going from positive to negative; vertical dotted lines mark these points. Bottom: a row of equally spaced grey dots labelled at rest, and below it the same fluid elements after the displacement, in black. The black dots bunch up at the dotted lines, labelled compression, and spread out half a wavelength later, labelled rarefaction.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[230]/Pg 15804 0 R>>
endobj
